creatures:
- name: Giant Owl
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 12  
      **Hit Points** 19 (rollable(dice=3d10 + 3,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 5 ft., Fly 60 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** necrotic, radiant  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Celestial; understands Common, Elvish, and Sylvan but can't speak them  
      **Challenge** 1/4 (50 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Flyby.*** The owl doesn't provoke an Opportunity Attack when it flies out of an enemy's reach.

      ## Actions

      ***Talons.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Talons]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+2,dicelabel=Damage [Talons]) Slashing damage.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The owl casts one of the following spells, requiring no spell components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability:

      At will: [Detect Evil and Good](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619090-detect-evil-and-good), [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic)  
      1/day: [Clairvoyance](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618972-clairvoyance)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Celestial, Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 1/4
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024giantowl
  status: 1

